\p{
  This Agda mechanization accompanies [[grodin-chu-li-hoffmann-harper-2026]]. It formalizes the value- and computation-level modalities, fracture and gluing, potential functions as types, credits and debits, the batched-queue case study, and the embedding of Giralf in Calf. It is checked with Agda 2.8.0, the Agda standard library 2.3, and the Cubical library 0.9.
}
